FINAL ANSWER:
**Ask Gonzalo Rodriguez first. Ask Divya Rao and Hye-jin Park as well if you can. For PR review, pick Gonzalo plus Divya or Hye-jin.**

I ranked people by surviving lines in `lib/rack/attack/store_proxy`, using `git blame -w -M -C`. The directory has 276 attributed non-blank lines (346 with blank lines).

